Moreover, this course provides students chances for hands-on exercises and practices of legal writing and research, the critical academic skills for the preparation and completion of master thesis. Therefore, this course aims to:
equip students with basic understandings of different legal methods that have emerged in international legal scholarship;
foster the ability to analyze relevant WTO cases through the lenses of different legal theories or methodologies;
